# The build of the Dockerfile needs only the Go module, its sources and those of request-cert and
# token-setup, the embedded assets and page templates, the help serve shows at /help/ and the
# guides serve --docs shows at /docs/.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!cmd/request-cert
!cmd/token-setup
!assets
!templates
!help
!docs/*.md
